			<p class="Punktlistalinje" style="margin-bottom:0pt; -aw-import:list-item; -aw-list-level-number:0; -aw-list-number-format:'–'; -aw-list-number-styles:'bullet'; -aw-list-padding-sml:9.2pt">
				<span style="-aw-import:ignore"><span style="font-size:10pt">–</span><span style="width:9.2pt; font:7pt 'Verdana'; display:inline-block; -aw-import:spaces">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0; </span></span><span>Företagande och investeringar</span>
